# external sensors on J1 (pin 27/28; module VCC/GND: MQ-2 -> J1-11 5V / J1-12 GND, flame -> J1-29 3.3V / J1-30 GND)
# MQ-2 / flame DO active low, internal pull-up = inactive when unplugged (active-high flame module: FIRE_HI = 1 + PULLDOWN); MQ-2 DO is pulled to 5V on the module -> divide to 3.3V
